@@ -0,0 +1,195 @@
+/*********************************************************************************
+ * @file		mec_adapter.cpp
+ * @brief		
+ * @details		
+ * @author		ChangXuhui
+ * @date		2024/02/27 
+ * @copyright	Copyright (c) 2024 Cictci V2X Division.
+ * @verbatim
+ *
